mlxConsole.modelOverrides.markdownDescription:
Per-model generation overrides, keyed by model id (or a converted model's local path). Any omitted field falls back to the `mlxConsole.sampling.*` defaults.

```json
{
  "mlx-community/Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct-4bit": { "temperature": 0.2, "maxTokens": 4096 }
}
```
